sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 👤 Usuário
    participant CH as 🗨️ Canal<br/>(TG/WA/Web)
    participant GW as 🧠 Gateway
    participant QD as 🔀 Quick Dispatch
    participant RR as 📋 Recipe Runner
    participant W as ⚙️ Worker<br/>(provider chain)
    participant AR as 🤖 auto-reviewer
    participant HR as 👥 Human Reviewer
    participant S3 as 💾 S3/MinIO

    rect rgba(45, 90, 61, 0.2)
        Note over U,S3: FLUXO A — pedido simples: "gera uma imagem de X"
        U->>CH: texto
        CH->>GW: IncomingMessage
        GW->>GW: classifica: simples
        GW->>QD: dispatch_job(image.generation)
        QD->>W: Job → 1º local (Stable Diffusion)
        W->>S3: salva imagem
        W-->>QD: JobResult
        QD-->>GW: pronto
        GW-->>CH: OutgoingMessage + anexo
        CH-->>U: 🖼️ imagem
    end

    rect rgba(93, 61, 45, 0.2)
        Note over U,S3: FLUXO B — campanha composta
        U->>CH: "cria campanha Y"
        CH->>GW: IncomingMessage
        GW->>GW: classifica: composto
        GW->>RR: run_recipe(campanha-marketing)
        RR->>W: stage research (opt-in)
        W-->>RR: pesquisa de mercado
        RR->>AR: aprova brief? (critérios)
        AR-->>RR: approved ✓
        RR->>W: stage copy
        W-->>RR: narrativa
        RR->>CH: "aprovar copy?"
        CH->>U: pergunta
        U-->>CH: "sim"
        CH-->>RR: approved ✓
        par stages paralelos
            RR->>W: images (inemaimg local)
        and
            RR->>W: voiceover (inemavox local)
        end
        W->>S3: artefatos
        RR->>W: video (compõe imagens + áudio)
        W->>S3: vídeo final
        RR->>HR: aprovar vídeo? (supervisor)
        HR-->>RR: approved ✓
        RR-->>CH: pacote pronto
        CH-->>U: 💬 chat + ⬇️ link ZIP + 📣 botão publicar
    end
